# Upload filter for `gcloud builds submit` (scripts/deploy-api.sh). Without this file gcloud silently derives
# one from .gitignore, which is not the Docker context. Base = the Docker ignore file, plus what the API image
# never needs but the web image does (Cloud Build here builds the API only; the web app deploys via Vercel):
# the first upload carried 48 MiB of web art and timed out on the way to the bucket.
#!include:.dockerignore
apps/web/public/
apps/web/src/
apps/web/*.css
packages/asset-gen/tools/
packages/asset-gen/src/templates/
